            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "NADES"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is very easy and good. I used pineapple juice and lemon-lime soda, but substituted strawberry sherbet instead. Very nice! I was thinking of making this for 'adults only' one day, so I'm going to try adding some sparkling wine. I'm sure that would give it a nice 'kick'.",
            "datePublished": "2000-07-18T00:41:01.377Z"
